Error: Jet.ClosedSetElse: This `else` can never run; every case of `Level` is already handled
  --> Tests/UI/else_after_exhaustive_arms.jet:13:9
    |
 13 |         else -> "other"
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Level` is a closed set: an `else` would take any case added to `Level` later silently, instead of the compiler asking you to handle it
 Fix: Delete the `else` arm
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ClosedSetElse
